<tr><td>Nails</td><td>Placodes <strong class="ex-n">9 weeks</strong>（p.52）</td><td>Evident at <strong class="ex-n">9 weeks</strong>（McKee p.3）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Volar sweat glands</td><td><strong class="ex-n">12–13 weeks</strong>（p.58）；其他部位 20 weeks</td><td>Palms and soles <strong class="ex-n">9 weeks</strong>；其他部位 <strong class="ex-n">15 weeks</strong>（McKee p.3）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Sebaceous glands</td><td><strong class="ex-n">13th–14th weeks</strong>（p.58）</td><td>Appear at <strong class="ex-n">15 weeks</strong>；differentiated at 13–15 weeks（McKee p.3、p.5）</td></tr>
